  (:adr/related
  (vector "90-docs/adr/2607121000-cloud-itonami-global-isic-isco-reverse-toposort-plan.edn（ISCO occupation-actor track の全体計画、Wave3: production/trades、92xx/96xx elementary-occupations subgroup の最終バッチの最後の1件）"
